From 5f3e5d12d5c8574ef23f747b799a02a83014e397 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Christian Jaeger <ch@christianjaeger.ch>
Date: Mon, 12 Jun 2023 15:51:01 +0200
Subject: .chj-home/init 001: [PATCH 162/191] init: clone chj-emacs per user now

Not running make in chj-emacs automatically because it retrieves quite
a large amount of things that not every user may need.
---
 .chj-home/init | 15 ++++++++++-----
 1 file changed, 10 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)

diff --git a/.chj-home/init b/.chj-home/init
--- a/.chj-home/init
+++ b/.chj-home/init
@@ -119,5 +123,4 @@ EOF
 
-ln -s /opt/chj/emacs/.emacs.d
 
 if [ -e ~/.lesskey ]; then
     lesskey
